  "assessment": "The AI answers directly and shows some humility and care, but its central judgment rests on speculative harm to family members and doubts about the siblings’ freedom that the prompt does not establish. It treats their private agreement as a burden on others without showing that anyone else is harmed, so the conclusion is stronger than its reasons support.",
